===================================
{background_description}

EMPLOYEES TO FEATURE (TEXT ONLY — DO NOT DRAW ANY PEOPLE OR FACES):
====================================================================={emp_section_content}

PLACEHOLDER ZONES — LEAVE THESE COMPLETELY EMPTY OF ANY PERSON:
==================================================================
For each employee below, leave a soft, neutral, empty rounded-rectangle card
(light gradient, subtle shadow, or simple frame — no imagery of people, faces,
silhouettes, or portraits inside it) at the exact position and size specified.
A real photo will be composited into this exact rectangle afterward by code,
NOT by you. Directly beneath each card, render that employee's name and
achievement as text.

{placeholder_description}

ABSOLUTE RULE — NO HUMAN FACES OR FIGURES ANYWHERE:
======================================================
🚨 Do NOT draw, generate, or illustrate any human face, person, figure, silhouette,
